4 | security-reviewer | SECURITY REVIEW of the PR on branch fix/ac-resource-is-iris. Read-only; tmp writes only. Record head SHA at start and at report. The change moves the token audience from the API to the Iris MCP URL and decouples the issuer. Check: a token minted for the Iris resource cannot be replayed against any API path outside the assistant tool surface; the issuer in the discovery document equals the origin serving it; the resource parameter is validated on both authorize and token and a mismatch fails closed; the middleware audience check cannot be satisfied by the old value; nothing in the change widens what an assistant token can reach. Post ONE comment on issue 2340 whose first line reads SECURITY RESOURCE IS IRIS with a final SAFE or BLOCK line. HOUSE STYLE: no long dash, no AI tool or vendor name. | fix/ac-resource-is-iris
